# Per-photograph metadata for the Akash Movers gallery.
#
# WRITTEN BY LOOKING AT THE PHOTOGRAPHS, not at their filenames. Each entry
# describes what is actually visible in the frame. Where something could not
# be identified with confidence -- whether a wrapped box is a refrigerator or
# a cabinet, for instance -- the description says "item" rather than guessing,
# because alt text that names the wrong object is worse than alt text that
# describes the wrapping.
#
# Nothing here claims a customer, a location, a date or a job reference. The
# photographs show the company's packing work and that is all they are said
# to show.
#
# n     the number in the contact sheet, which is also the sort order
# slug  the published filename stem -- descriptive, not keyword-stuffed
# alt   for screen readers and image search; every one is different
# cap    the visible caption under the photo, or '' for none

